diff --git a/.changeset/chat-manifest-trim.md b/.changeset/chat-manifest-trim.md
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..d37e7856
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.changeset/chat-manifest-trim.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+"@jini-ai/chat": minor
+---
+
+`@jini-ai/chat` declares no `@jini-ai/*` package except `@jini-ai/core` and `@jini-ai/protocol` (and `kysely`). `@jini-ai/db` and `@jini-ai/diagnostics` leave its dependencies, and the optional `@jini-ai/agent-runtime` and `@jini-ai/ui` peers are gone: chat reaches them only through its kit and policy ports, so a host declares `@jini-ai/ui` and `@jini-ai/agent-runtime` itself and binds them (all three Tovu hosts already do).
